# Accessibility

- Keyboard-only play is required for essential functions.
- Colour is never the only meaning.
- Provide reduced-motion and skippable effects before animated combat ships.
- Health, maps, and targets need text alternatives and numeric values.
- Important events belong in a live region and in the transcript.
